1. Relationship to OpenClaw
---------------------------

EasyClaw is an unofficial third-party installer for OpenClaw
(https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw). It is not affiliated with or endorsed
by the OpenClaw project or its maintainers. The name "OpenClaw" is used here
only to describe the software that EasyClaw installs.


2. OpenClaw software
--------------------

EasyClaw does not ship a copy of OpenClaw. During setup it installs OpenClaw
on the user's machine from the npm registry
(`npm install -g openclaw@latest`). OpenClaw is separate software and is
governed by its own license:

  https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/blob/main/LICENSE


3. Mascot artwork
-----------------

The EasyClaw mascot is a modified version of the OpenClaw mascot artwork.

  Original file:  ui/public/favicon.svg
  Repository:     https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw
  Version used:   the file as added in upstream commit
                  02576615cb4c1382abf1d0aee10ed10f1f676e78 (2026-01-30). It
                  was unchanged in the upstream repository when the EasyClaw
                  mascot was made on 2026-02-17 (EasyClaw commit ec82125).
  Permalink:      https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/blob/02576615cb4c1382abf1d0aee10ed10f1f676e78/ui/public/favicon.svg

Changes made for EasyClaw: the artwork was recolored from red to orange; the
path coordinates, eye size and position, and antenna stroke width were
adjusted; a background glow and status color variants (success, error) were
added.

The modified artwork appears in:

  - src/renderer/src/components/LobsterLogo.tsx
  - docs/index.html and docs/og-image.html (inline SVG)
  - images rendered from it: build/icon.png, build/icon.icns, build/icon.ico,
    resources/icon.png, docs/favicon.png, docs/og-image.png, and the app
    screenshots and demo recording under docs/

